---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { GATED_DELTA_SD_LORA_PUBLICATION as snapshot } from '../../data/gatedDeltaSdLoraPublicationSnapshot';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const historyHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gdr-directapply/');
const vanillaHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/vanilla-sd-lora/');
const flaHref = 'https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention/blob/516143e31fce09925e6c39ac37148444bad176c4/fla/ops/gated_delta_rule/naive.py';
const paperHref = 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.06464';
const evidenceFor = (id: string) => id === 'beta-g'
  ? [snapshot.evidence.treatmentDecision, snapshot.evidence.d1Preregistration, snapshot.evidence.d26Qualification]
  : id === 'optimizer-factor'
    ? [snapshot.evidence.eventWriteDesign, snapshot.evidence.treatmentDecision]
    : [snapshot.evidence.eventWriteDesign];
---

<article class="gds-page" data-testid="gated-delta-sd-lora-page" data-copy-review data-reader-page="research-explainer">
  <header class="gds-hero" data-reader-context id="top">
    <a class="gds-back" href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/')}>← {t('OpenEvo 能力探索', 'OpenEvo capability exploration')}</a>
    <h1>Gated-Delta SD-LoRA</h1>
    <p class="gds-hero__lede" data-reader-task data-reader-purpose>{t(
      '我们之前做的本地 GDR-v1 放错了层级：SD-LoRA candidate 已经训练完成以后，它才用 16 道题决定“要不要采用”。现在研究的是：一次新的学习证据（learning event）出现时，直接产生连续写入，让 LoRA 参数状态本身按 Gated Delta recurrence 更新。',
      'Our historical local GDR-v1 operated at the wrong layer: only after an SD-LoRA candidate had already been trained did a 16-task probe decide whether to adopt it. The current research instead starts from a new piece of learning evidence (a learning event) and writes directly into the LoRA parameter state through a Gated Delta recurrence.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="gds-hero__state"><strong>{t('真实 GDR 路径已经跑通；方法效果还没有结论。', 'The real GDR path now runs; method efficacy is still unresolved.')}</strong> {t('Route S 已在真实 Qwen3-1.7B × WebShop learning opportunity 上执行 Gated-Delta 参数写入，证明这条 recurrent factor-state 路径不是纸面设计。完整四轮 Vanilla vs GDR paired D1 仍未完成，因此不能把 execution proof 写成“GDR 更好”。', 'Route S executed Gated-Delta parameter writes on a real Qwen3-1.7B × WebShop learning opportunity, proving the recurrent factor-state path is real rather than a paper design. The full four-round Vanilla-vs-GDR paired D1 is still incomplete, so execution proof is not an efficacy claim.')}</p>
    <p class="gds-hero__history"><a href={historyHref}>{t('查看历史 GDR-v1 / DirectApply 实验记录 →', 'Open the historical GDR-v1 / DirectApply experiment record →')}</a></p>
  </header>

  <section class="gds-section" id="recurrence" aria-labelledby="recurrence-title">
    <h2 id="recurrence-title">{t('原始 Gated Delta Rule 更新的是 State', 'The original Gated Delta Rule updates State')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '原始规则没有等一个完整 candidate 训练完再做外部 PASS / FAIL。当前输入先给出 key、value 和 gate；旧 State 被读取，当前 value 与旧读数的差形成 residual，再由 β 控制这次 residual 写回多少。',
      'The original rule does not wait for a full candidate and then run an external PASS / FAIL. The current input produces a key, value, and gates; the old State is read, the difference between the current value and that readout forms a residual, and β controls how much of that residual is written back.'
    )}</p>
    <figure class="gds-recurrence" data-testid="gated-delta-recurrence">
      <div class="gds-signal"><span>{t('当前学习信号', 'current learning signal')}</span><strong>x<sub>t</sub> → k<sub>t</sub>, v<sub>t</sub>, β<sub>t</sub>, g<sub>t</sub></strong></div>
      <div class="gds-flow" aria-label={t('Gated Delta recurrent state flow', 'Gated Delta recurrent state flow')}>
        <div class="gds-node is-state"><small>{t('旧状态', 'prior State')}</small><strong>S<sub>t−1</sub></strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-read"><small>{t('衰减并读取', 'decay + read')}</small><strong>S̃ = exp(g)S<br />read = S̃k</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-write"><small>{t('算差值并写回', 'residual + write')}</small><strong>r = v − read<br />β · r</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-next"><small>{t('新状态', 'next State')}</small><strong>S<sub>t</sub></strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gds-equation" aria-label={t('Gated Delta Rule 简式', 'Simplified Gated Delta Rule')}>
        <code>S̃<sub>t−1</sub> = exp(g<sub>t</sub>) S<sub>t−1</sub></code>
        <code>r<sub>t</sub> = v<sub>t</sub> − S̃<sub>t−1</sub> k<sub>t</sub></code>
        <code>S<sub>t</sub> = S̃<sub>t−1</sub> + β<sub>t</sub> k<sub>t</sub> r<sub>t</sub><sup>T</sup></code>
      </div>
      <figcaption>{t('不同实现可能转置张量方向，但语义不变：先读旧 State，再把没有解释掉的 residual 连续写回。', 'Implementations may transpose tensor orientation, but the semantics stay the same: read the old State, then continuously write back the unexplained residual.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="gds-sources"><a href={flaHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={flaHref} />Flash Linear Attention reference</a> · <a href={paperHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={paperHref} />Gated Delta Networks</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section" id="task-vector" aria-labelledby="task-vector-title">
    <h2 id="task-vector-title">{t('Task Vector 只做事后分析，不参与在线更新', 'Task Vector stays diagnostic and does not control online updates')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Task Vector 仍然有用，但角色变了。它记录一次训练前后参数状态实际移动了多少、朝哪里移动；它帮助我们回看 Vanilla / DirectApply 的几何，也可以做 offline teacher 或事后比较。', 'Task Vector remains useful, but its role changed. It records how far and in what direction parameter state moved across an update; it can describe Vanilla / DirectApply geometry, serve as an offline teacher, or support post-hoc comparison.')}</p>
    <div class="gds-tv-boundary">
      <dl>
        <div><dt>{t('可以用来', 'Allowed')}</dt><dd>{t('retrospective geometry · offline teacher / label · post-hoc evaluation', 'retrospective geometry · offline teacher / label · post-hoc evaluation')}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{t('不能进入', 'Forbidden at runtime')}</dt><dd>K / V · β · g · WebShop score / reward · candidate probe</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <code>Δθ<sub>t</sub> = θ<sub>t</sub> − θ<sub>t−1</sub></code>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="gds-section" id="derivation" aria-labelledby="derivation-title">
    <h2 id="derivation-title">{t('为什么最后把 State 放进 LoRA factors', 'Why State ended up in the LoRA factors')}</h2>
    <p>{t('每一步证据都会缩小下一步还能合理尝试什么。主线只保留“当时在猜什么、证据怎样改变判断、为什么因此进入下一步”；完整 D0 编号和数值放在相邻证据里。', 'Each result narrows what remains reasonable to try next. The mainline keeps only the hypothesis, what changed our judgment, and why that forced the next step; exact D0 identifiers and metrics remain in local evidence.')}</p>
    <ol class="gds-derivation">
      {snapshot.derivation.map((step, index) => (
        <li>
          <div class="gds-derivation__index" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</div>
          <div class="gds-derivation__body">
            <small>{t(step.readerLabelZh, step.readerLabelEn)}</small>
            <h3>{t(step.titleZh, step.titleEn)}</h3>
            <p>{t(step.bodyZh, step.bodyEn)}</p>
            <details>
              <summary>{t('查看这一步的研究证据', 'Open evidence for this step')}</summary>
              <p class="gds-evidence-status"><code>{step.verdict}</code></p>
              <div class="gds-evidence-links">
                {evidenceFor(step.id).map((href) => <a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={href} />{href.includes('json') ? t('机器证据（需仓库权限）', 'machine evidence (repository access required)') : t('研究文档（需仓库权限）', 'research note (repository access required)')}</a>)}
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section" id="factor-state" aria-labelledby="factor-state-title">
    <h2 id="factor-state-title">{t('参数 State 直接留在 LoRA 的 rank-8 factors 里', 'Parameter State stays directly in the rank-8 LoRA factors')}</h2>
    <p>{t('这里的 A 和 C 是 LoRA 真正保存的低秩参数因子。我们不再先生成一个完整大矩阵再重新分解：真实学习事件提供局部信号，当前 A / C 与已有 AdamW memory 保存因果历史，再由冻结的 beta policy 决定这次写入多强。', 'A and C are the low-rank LoRA factors that actually persist. Instead of materializing a full matrix and factorizing it again, a real learning event provides local signals, current A / C plus prior AdamW memory carry causal history, and the frozen beta policy sets write strength.')}</p>
    <figure class="gds-runtime" data-testid="gated-delta-runtime-path">
      <div class="gds-runtime__flow">
        <div class="gds-node is-event"><small>{t('真实 learning event', 'real learning event')}</small><strong>{t('activation + supervised error', 'activation + supervised error')}</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-signal"><small>{t('factor-local causal signal', 'factor-local causal signal')}</small><strong>{t('clipped gradients / token-local geometry', 'clipped gradients / token-local geometry')}</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-memory"><small>{t('当前状态 + 因果历史', 'current state + causal history')}</small><strong>A · C<sup>T</sup> · AdamW moments</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-gate"><small>{t('连续写入控制', 'continuous write control')}</small><strong>β<sub>policy</sub> · g = 0</strong></div>
        <div class="gds-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="gds-node is-next"><small>{t('下一 factor State', 'next factor State')}</small><strong>S<sub>A</sub> = A · S<sub>C</sub> = C<sup>T</sup></strong></div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>{t(`第一版 D1 只在 ${snapshot.treatmentScope.gatedModules} 使用这个 treatment；其它 adapted modules 仍保持 Vanilla DirectApply SD-LoRA update。`, `First D1 applies this treatment only to ${snapshot.treatmentScope.gatedModules}; all other adapted modules keep the Vanilla DirectApply SD-LoRA update.`)}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="gds-related"><a href={vanillaHref}>{t('对照阅读：Vanilla SD-LoRA 一轮怎样更新 →', 'Compare with one Vanilla SD-LoRA update →')}</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="gds-section gds-d1" id="d1-boundary" aria-labelledby="d1-boundary-title">
    <h2 id="d1-boundary-title">{t('现在证明了“真的跑起来”，还没有证明“效果更好”', 'We have proved real execution, not better efficacy')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Route S 已完成一个真实 task-bearing GDR smoke：128 次 WebShop rollout 产生真实学习机会，随后 SD-LoRA update 在冻结的 Gated-Delta treatment 下执行。它证明 GDR 确实进入了 1.7B 的参数更新路径；这不是 fixture、不是离线 Task Vector replay，也不是 candidate admission。', 'Route S completed a real task-bearing GDR smoke: 128 WebShop rollouts produced a genuine learning opportunity, followed by an SD-LoRA update under the frozen Gated-Delta treatment. This proves GDR really entered the 1.7B parameter-update path; it was not a fixture, offline Task-Vector replay, or candidate admission.')}</p>
    <dl class="gds-d1__facts">
      <div><dt>Route S</dt><dd>{t(`${snapshot.routeSExecution.attemptCount} rollouts · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.semanticTaskIdentityCount} 个任务 · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessCount} 条 clean exact success（覆盖 ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessTaskCount} 个任务）`, `${snapshot.routeSExecution.attemptCount} rollouts · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.semanticTaskIdentityCount} tasks · ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessCount} clean exact successes across ${snapshot.routeSExecution.cleanExactSuccessTaskCount} tasks`)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('真实参数写入', 'Real parameter write')}</dt><dd>{snapshot.routeSExecution.optimizerSteps} optimizer steps · {snapshot.routeSExecution.appliedFactorWrites.toLocaleString('en-US')} factor writes · {snapshot.routeSExecution.zeroDirectionNoops} zero-direction no-ops</dd></div>
      <div><dt>β / g</dt><dd>β ∈ [{snapshot.routeSExecution.betaMinObserved.toExponential(2)}, {snapshot.routeSExecution.betaMaxObserved.toFixed(6)}] · <code>g = 0</code> · {t('全部 retention 精确为 1', 'all retention exactly 1')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('禁止信号', 'Forbidden signals')}</dt><dd>{t('Task Vector runtime reads = 0 · reward / score controller = false · candidate probe reads = 0 · final panel access = 0', 'Task Vector runtime reads = 0 · reward / score controller = false · candidate probe reads = 0 · final panel access = 0')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('完整 paired D1', 'Full paired D1')}</dt><dd>{t('尚未完成。两条 arm 的 matched Round-0 rollout 已发生，但四轮 Vanilla-vs-GDR paired 结果仍未封存。', 'Not complete. Matched Round-0 rollouts have occurred on both arms, but the four-round Vanilla-vs-GDR paired result is not sealed.')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('final panel', 'Final panel')}</dt><dd>{t('仍关闭；Route S 与当前 paired recovery 都没有打开它。', 'Still closed; neither Route S nor the current paired recovery opened it.')}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="gds-d1__boundary">{t('因此现在能说的是：这条 Gated-Delta SD-LoRA 机制已经在真实 WebShop 学习事件上完成过参数更新。还不能说的是：它比 Vanilla 更好、长期更稳定，或会提高 final。那些问题必须等完整 paired D1。', 'The supported claim is now that Gated-Delta SD-LoRA has performed a real parameter update on a genuine WebShop learning event. We still cannot claim it beats Vanilla, is more stable long-term, or improves final performance; those questions require the full paired D1.')}</p>
    <nav class="gds-evidence-nav" aria-label={t('当前 Gated-Delta 研究证据', 'Current Gated-Delta research evidence')}>
      <a href={snapshot.evidence.routeSExecutionSeal} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={snapshot.evidence.routeSExecutionSeal} />{t('Route S 执行封存（需仓库权限）', 'Route S execution seal (repository access required)')}</a>
      <a href={snapshot.evidence.pairedPostrolloutRecovery} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={snapshot.evidence.pairedPostrolloutRecovery} />{t('paired Round-0 recovery（需仓库权限）', 'paired Round-0 recovery (repository access required)')}</a>
      <a href={snapshot.evidence.d1ExecutionPlan} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={snapshot.evidence.d1ExecutionPlan} />{t('D1 execution / closeout authority（需仓库权限）', 'D1 execution / closeout authority (repository access required)')}</a>
      <a href={snapshot.evidence.upstreamPr} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={snapshot.evidence.upstreamPr} />PR #461</a>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <footer class="gds-provenance">
    <strong>{t('科研状态来源', 'Scientific-state source')}</strong>
    <span>{snapshot.source.repository} · <code>{snapshot.source.branch}</code> · <code>{snapshot.source.head.slice(0, 12)}</code> · {snapshot.checkedAt}</span>
    <span>{t('这是网站发布快照；正式发布前仍会重新读取上游 scientific head。', 'This is a website publication snapshot; the upstream scientific head will be refreshed again before release.')}</span>
  </footer>
</article>
<style>
.gds-page{width:min(1060px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto;padding:2.4rem 0 5rem;color:var(--text)}
.gds-hero{padding:1rem 0 2.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.gds-back,.gds-hero__history a,.gds-related a,.gds-sources a,.gds-evidence-nav a,.gds-evidence-links a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:750;text-underline-offset:.2em}.gds-hero h1{margin:.9rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,7vw,5.4rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em}.gds-hero__lede{max-width:54rem;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.6vw,1.65rem);line-height:1.62}.gds-hero__state{max-width:50rem;margin:1.1rem 0 .5rem;padding:.8rem 0 .8rem 1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6}.gds-hero__state strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.15rem}.gds-hero__history{margin:.75rem 0 .1rem;font-size:1rem}
.gds-section{padding:2.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.gds-section>h2{max-width:48rem;margin:0 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.13;letter-spacing:-.025em}.gds-section>p{max-width:50rem;margin:.7rem 0;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.72}.gds-section>p.gds-sources,.gds-section>p.gds-related{font-size:1rem;color:var(--muted)}
.gds-recurrence{margin:1.6rem 0 0}.gds-signal{width:min(31rem,100%);margin:0 auto 1.25rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent);background:var(--surface-muted)}.gds-signal span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem}.gds-signal strong{display:block;margin-top:.25rem}.gds-flow,.gds-runtime__flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0,1fr);align-items:stretch}.gds-node{min-width:0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}.gds-node small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}.gds-node strong{display:block;margin-top:.35rem;line-height:1.45}.gds-node.is-state,.gds-node.is-memory{border-color:#75639b}.gds-node.is-read,.gds-node.is-signal{border-color:#b98235}.gds-node.is-write,.gds-node.is-gate{border-color:#a15448}.gds-node.is-next{border-color:#4f7c66}.gds-node.is-event{border-color:#527b9d}.gds-connector{position:relative;min-height:3rem}.gds-connector:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:.45rem;top:50%;height:1px;background:var(--muted)}.gds-connector:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:.15rem;top:calc(50% - .28rem);border-left:.5rem solid var(--muted);border-block:.28rem solid transparent}.gds-equation{display:grid;gap:.35rem;margin:1rem 0;padding:1.05rem 1.2rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep);background:var(--surface-muted);font-size:1rem}.gds-recurrence figcaption,.gds-runtime figcaption{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.62}
.gds-tv-boundary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1.5rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.4rem;padding-block:1rem;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.gds-tv-boundary dl{margin:0}.gds-tv-boundary dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:8rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:.45rem 0}.gds-tv-boundary dt{font-weight:800}.gds-tv-boundary dd{margin:0;line-height:1.55}.gds-tv-boundary>code{font-size:1.05rem;white-space:nowrap}
.gds-derivation{list-style:none;margin:1.6rem 0 0;padding:0}.gds-derivation>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;padding:1.6rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.gds-derivation__index{font:800 1rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent-deep)}.gds-derivation__body small{color:var(--muted);font:700 1rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.gds-derivation__body h3{margin:.35rem 0 .45rem;font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.3}.gds-derivation__body p{max-width:48rem;margin:0;font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.68}.gds-derivation details{margin-top:.75rem}.gds-derivation summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:750}.gds-evidence-status{margin:.7rem 0 .2rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem}.gds-evidence-links,.gds-evidence-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 1rem;margin-top:.7rem}.gds-evidence-links a,.gds-evidence-nav a{font-size:1rem}
.gds-runtime{margin:1.5rem 0 0}.gds-runtime__flow{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1fr)}.gds-d1{border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep);padding-left:1.25rem}.gds-d1__facts{margin:1.25rem 0}.gds-d1__facts>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:8rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:.65rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.gds-d1__facts dt{font-weight:800}.gds-d1__facts dd{margin:0;line-height:1.55}.gds-d1__boundary{font-weight:650}.gds-provenance{display:grid;gap:.35rem;padding-top:1.6rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.55}.gds-provenance strong{color:var(--text)}.gds-provenance code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width:820px){.gds-page{width:min(100% - 1rem,1060px);padding-top:1.3rem}.gds-flow,.gds-runtime__flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gds-connector{min-height:2.3rem}.gds-connector:before{left:50%;right:auto;top:.2rem;bottom:.45rem;width:1px;height:auto}.gds-connector:after{right:auto;left:calc(50% - .28rem);top:auto;bottom:.1rem;border-top:.5rem solid var(--muted);border-inline:.28rem solid transparent;border-left-color:transparent}.gds-tv-boundary{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gds-tv-boundary dl>div,.gds-d1__facts>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.25rem}.gds-tv-boundary>code{white-space:normal}.gds-derivation>li{grid-template-columns:2.5rem minmax(0,1fr)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.gds-page{scroll-behavior:auto}.gds-page *{animation:none;transition:none}}
</style>
